  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support communities  recovering from COVID-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support families in rural communities, El Salvador, supporting their livelihoods, mental health as well as long-term resilience.  The project will provide families with critical agricultural inputs and support entrepreneurship initiatives. Books and other educational material will be purchased for community libraries, and a psychology specialist will be hired to help families cope with the stress and other symptoms caused by the pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
